Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 14:12:44 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] media: atomisp: backport streaming error-path fixes to
 6.12

Upstream 751d13a0cffb, 41dd1f2fac32, 2194e6066ae0 and 0193cce58b19.
Without them a failed STREAMON leaves buffers queued in the driver and the
next one corrupts the vb2 list.
